---
output: svg
---
@startuml
' Regression test: with "stateDiagramEdgeLabelStyle node", a transition's
' label is drawn as its own intermediate node (see
' CommandLinkStateCommon.createTransitionWithIntermediateNode). That node
' carries none of its transition's tags, so a 'remove' that only matches one
' of the two real endpoints used to leave the label floating with a dangling
' arrow to nowhere instead of disappearing along with its endpoint (fixed in
' CucaDiagram.isOrphanedTransitionLabel).
skinparam stateDiagramEdgeLabelStyle node

state Idle $keep
state Charging $keep
state Faulted

Idle -> Charging : start / begin()
Charging -> Faulted : fault(5 s)

remove $keep
restore $nonexistent
@enduml
